.TH SDE-VIEW 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-view \- SDE image viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-view
[OPTIONS] FILES...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open image files with Photo, the native SDE picture viewer (based on Eye of MATE).
The Effects side pane (Tools > Effects and Filters, or E) previews filters and
adjustments live and saves an edited copy; the original file is not changed.
.PP
This is an independent native executable built from the SDE fork sources
and included in the sde package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display the native application options.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Original upstream copyrights and licenses are preserved. Settings at the SDE
Suite page provides the source link and full installed notice.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-settings (1),
.BR sde-suite (1)
